,"rv":"","rvt":"","rvd":"","log":[],"rp":0,"dlcs":[]},{"id":191940,"t":"Enslaved: Odyssey to the West","shelf":"Played","shelves":["Played"],"added":"2026-04-18","pf":[],"r":4,"g":["Adventure","Platform","Puzzle"],"fr":[],"dev":["Ninja Theory"],"pub":["Namco Bandai Games"],"rel":"2010-10-05","u":"https://www.grouvee.com/games/191940-enslaved-odyssey-to-the-west/","rv":"I was gifted the disc on my console by my uncle. I started the game knowing nothing, expecting nothing, but at the end of it, I came out a person with deep love and memories rooted at my core, recommending this game to all those who may enjoy a good game. Its a platformer, a hack and slash and survival adventure kind of a thing, but what makes it amazing is the way it all comes together. The characters, their growth, bonding, the world, the fuckin dog (you would know what I mean if u played it) and so much more. Its a shame not so many people know of this game. I would have never as well, but I was lucky, and I am glad. While it may not have aged well compared to modern standards and expectations, it holds solid as an amazing experience.","rvt":"An underrated Gem","rvd":"2026-04-18","log":[],"rp":0,"dlcs":[]},{"id":193464,"t":"Death Stranding","shelf":"Wish List","shelves":["Wish List"],"added":"2026-04-18","pf":[],"r":0,"g":["Adventure","Role-playing (RPG)","Shooter"],"fr":["Death Stranding"],"dev":["Kojima Productions"],"pub":["505 Games","Sony Interactive Entertainment"],"rel":"2019-11-08","u":"https://www.grouvee.com/games/193464-death-stranding/","rv":"","rvt":"","rvd":"","log":[],"rp":0,"dlcs":[]},{"id":195471,"t":"Dragon's Dogma","shelf":"Wish List","shelves":["Wish List"],"added":"2026-04-18","pf":[],"r":0,"g":["Adventure","Hack and slash/Beat 'em up","Role-playing (RPG)"],"fr":["Dragon's Dogma"],"dev":["Capcom"],"pub":["Capcom"],"rel":"2012-05-22","u":"https://www.grouvee.com/games/195471-dragons-dogma/","rv":"","rvt":"","rvd":"","log":[],"rp":0,"dlcs":[]},{"id":195642,"t":"Split Fiction","sh